merged article from Marco. Runs 11-point checklist. Reports pass/fail with routing to Marco.",budget:"~5k",spend:"—",notes:"Fail (copy) → Marco routes to Quill. Fail (visual) → Marco routes to Maya."},PT:{name:"Porter",role:"Publisher",job:"Initiated by Marco after Vera pass. git commit + push + deploy guard + GS log. Confirms live URL + GS row to Marco.",budget:"~8k",spend:"—",notes:"✓ Working — tested and approved Jun 21, 2026."},NV:{name:"Nova",role:"Marketing Agent",job:"Initiated by Marco after Porter confirms live. LinkedIn post + reshare. Reports company URN + reshare URN to Marco.",budget:"~20k",spend:"—",notes:"✓ Working — pipeline.py approved Jun 21, 2026."},EC:{name:"Echo",role:"Analytics: LinkedIn",job:"Daily autonomous run. Collects LinkedIn metrics 48h+ post-publish. Reports JSON summary to Lumen.",budget:"~5k",spend:"—",notes:"⚠ Token refresh needed — run linkedin_auth.py for r_member_social scope."},LM:{name:"Lumen",role:"Analytics Aggregator",job:"Receives Echo's LinkedIn report. Collects GA4, Meta, TikTok, BMC data. Consolidates and reports to Iris.",budget:"~10k",spend:"—",notes:"⚠ To build — lumen_secrets.json needed. No modules created yet."},CO:{name:"Cora",role:"Token & Quality Governor",job:"Parallel throughout. Tracks token spend, flags hallucinations and reversions. Reports daily to Iris.",budget:"~5k",spend:"—",notes:"⚠ To build — token_budget.json schema not yet created. Reports to Iris not Marco."}},nB=[{code:"IR",name:"Iris",role:"Pipeline Initiator",tier:"cyan",dotClass:"dot-ok"},{code:"MR",name:"Marco",role:"Production Manager",tier:"gold",dotClass:"dot-man"},{code:"PR",name:"Priya",role:"Editorial Planner",tier:"purple",dotClass:"dot-ok"},{code:"SC",name:"Scout",role:"Research Agent",tier:"green",dotClass:"dot-bld"},{code:"QL",name:"Quill",role:"Dawn · Joselito · Kenji",tier:"purple",dotClass:"dot-ok"},{code:"MY",name:"Maya",role:"Visual Director",tier:"purple",dotClass:"dot-bld"},{code:"VR",name:"Vera",role:"QC Gate",tier:"orange",d