l above the ~2% portfolio mean.`},{label:"Site traffic",tone:"good",text:`GA4 recorded ${p} sessions across ${r.length} article pages. LinkedIn referred ${f} sessions (${p?(f/p*100).toFixed(1):0}% of total). Top converter: "${x}" with ${v?.linkedin_sessions??0} LI referrals.`},{label:"Platform coverage",tone:"warn",text:"Only LinkedIn + GA4 collectors wired. Meta, TikTok, and BMC collectors still to build — lumen_secrets.json not yet created. Cross-platform summary (platform_summary.json) will be incomplete until these are wired."},{label:"Engagement quality",tone:"idea",text:"Avg engagement seconds varies wildly (2.8s on /aima-article-ai-in-medicine.html vs 181.7s on /aima-article-ethics-theater-014.html). The 181s outlier suggests the long-form ethics posts hold attention — Maya should lean into darker conceptual covers for this track."}],recommendations:["Build Meta + TikTok + BMC collectors (lumen_secrets.json pending).","Wire platform_summary.json unified schema across all 4 platforms.","Flag the 181s engagement outlier as a Quill tone reference for ethics-track posts."]},{agent:"Cora",role:"Token & Quality Governor",tier:"green",source:a?"token_budget.json (live)":"token_budget.json · token_log.csv",timestamp:"2026-06-22T08:00:00Z",findings:[{label:"Token budget",tone:a?"good":"warn",text:a?`token_budget.json loaded — ${a.agents.length} agents tracked. Run date: ${a.runDate||"—"}, Article #${a.articleNumber||"—"}. Total budget: ${a.agents.reduce((e,t)=>e+t.budget,0).toLocaleString()} tokens across ${a.agents.filter(e=>e.budget>0).length} LLM agents (remaining are mechanical with 0 cap). All agents currently idle — no pipeline run yet for article #${a.articleNumber||"—"}.`:"token_budget.json not loaded — per-agent budget caps are unenforced. Quill's 1,800-word ceiling is currently a prompt-level directive only, not a hard max_tokens cap. Risk: runaway Quill runs can spike cost without quality gain."},{label:"Budget allocation",tone:"idea",text:a?`Caps reflect agent role: Scout 50k (research-heavy), Quill 22k (long-form writing, max_tokens enforced), Maya 15k (image prompts + layout), Lumen 10k (cross-platform analytics), Iris 8k (strategic synthesis). Porter/Nova/Echo have 0 — they're mechanical (git/LinkedIn API/CSV) with no LLM calls. Allocation is sound but untested until first full run.`:"Recommend per-agent caps: Quill 22k (long-form), Scout 50k (research), Maya 15k (visual), Lumen 10k (analytics), Iris 8k (strategy). Mechanical agents (Porter, Nova, Echo) get 0 — no LLM calls."},{label:"Quality guardrails",tone:"idea",text:"Vera's 11-point QC checklist runs as a manual prompt — no automated checker yet. Recommend building a python validator that parses article HTML and outputs qc_pass/fail JSON with specific flag codes. Frees Vera from ad-hoc prompting and gives Marco machine-readable routing."},{label:"Hallucination watch",tone:"warn",text:`Stats and quotes in published articles are not yet cross-checked against Scout's research briefs. Article #014 ("Hallucination Nation") is itself a meta-example — the article about AI hallucination has no automated guardrail preventing hallucinated statistics. Build before scaling to ${i.filter(e=>!e.published).length} queued articles.`}],recommendations:a?["Run first full pipeline to populate token usage (currently all 0 / idle).","Build automated Vera QC checker (python HTML parser + 11-point checklist).","Implement hallucination guardrails on stats/quotes against Scout briefs.","Add token_log.csv history tracking for per-run cost trend analysis."]:["Create token_budget.json schema with per-agent caps (Quill: 22k, Iris: 8k, etc.).","Build automated Vera QC checker (python HTML parser + 11-point checklist).","Implement hallucination guardrails on stats/quotes against Scout briefs."]}]})({analytics:t,ga4Traffic:r,postLog:e.postLog,tokenBudget:e.tokenBudget,calendar:n}),[t,r,e.postLog,e.tokenBudget,n]),D={cyan:"var(--aima-cyan)",gold:"var(--aima-gold)",purple:"var(--aima-purple)"